## 🔑 Key Takeaways

- Kibana's file uploader ingests CSV, NDJSON, and log files straight from the UI. No pipeline to build.
- The course dataset lives in one index, `soc-lab`, with a data view of the same name.
- The data is dated. Set the time picker to cover it or Discover looks empty.
- Same logs for everyone means the labs have real, checkable answers.

